<section class="section section--soft teaching-method-section"><div class="container story-block__grid"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE TEACH</p><h2>Learning works better when learners can participate.</h2><p>SkillsPark combines explanation with hands-on participation. Learners are encouraged to ask questions, test ideas, work directly with tools and practise what they are learning. Teaching is adapted to the learner's background and stage so the environment remains challenging, supportive and practical.</p><p>A comfortable learning environment helps learners stay engaged, communicate freely and build confidence while developing new skills.</p></div><div class="editorial-media-grid editorial-media-grid--stack reveal"><picture class="editorial-media editorial-media--large"><source type="image/webp" srcset="<?= h(asset('images/training/participatory-learning/skillspark-participatory-learning-1-480.webp')) ?> 480w, <?= h(asset('images/training/participatory-learning/skillspark-participatory-learning-1-768.webp')) ?> 768w, <?= h(asset('images/training/participatory-learning/skillspark-participatory-learning-1-1200.webp')) ?> 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 32px), 34vw"><img src="<?= h(asset('images/training/participatory-learning/skillspark-participatory-learning-1-768.jpg')) ?>" srcset="<?= h(asset('images/training/participatory-learning/skillspark-participatory-learning-1-480.jpg')) ?> 480w, <?= h(asset('images/training/participatory-learning/skillspark-participatory-learning-1-768.jpg')) ?> 768w, <?= h(asset('images/training/participatory-learning/skillspark-participatory-learning-1-1200.jpg')) ?> 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 32px), 34vw" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="SkillsPark learners participating in a practical teaching session."></picture><picture class="editorial-media"><source type="image/webp" srcset="<?= h(asset('images/training/participatory-learning/skillspark-participatory-learning-2-480.webp'